@host = https://localhost:7121

### Create an order
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Cancel an existing order
POST {{host}}/orders/2/cancel
Accept: application/json

### Cancel an already cancelled order
POST {{host}}/orders/2/cancel
Accept: application/json

### Cancel an unknown order
POST {{host}}/orders/999/cancel
Accept: application/json